zuutf is licensed under the MIT licence (see LICENSE and LICENSE.md).

It bundles the simdutf library (https://github.com/simdutf/simdutf) in
src/vendor/simdutf/, taken unmodified from the single-header release
artefact of a pinned upstream release. simdutf is dual-licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 and the MIT licence, at the user's choice; zuutf takes
it under the MIT licence.


zuutf
=====

Copyright (c) 2026 Pedro Baltazar

Covers everything in the package except src/vendor/. Full text in
LICENSE.md; CRAN's YEAR/COPYRIGHT HOLDER form is in LICENSE.


simdutf
=======

Copyright (c) Daniel Lemire and the simdutf contributors

Bundled in src/vendor/simdutf/ under the MIT licence. The pinned release,
the SHA-256 of its archive and the import procedure are recorded in
tools/vendor/manifest.tsv in the source repository,
https://github.com/pedrobtz/zuutf; inst/COPYRIGHTS gives the copyright
holders and the licence text.
